  "speakerNotes": "Start with the game idea. The player wants to save a sold-out gig after a venue change. The local model interprets the premise against this record shop’s supported situations. The venue supplies guests, a stage crew and an archive. Word of mouth changes who arrives. The crew adapts its setup and waits for the archivist to find the soundcheck record. The original scenes let the audience explore each behavior independently. The hosted build offers saved interpretations and the local server accepts new wording.",
